+# Pre-registration exemptions for tools/check-research-node.py (audit finding F-024).
+#
+# Format: <research node directory> <reason>. One entry per line; the reason is mandatory.
+# An entry waives only PREREGISTRATION.md. The node still needs a numeric results file
+# and a research/LEDGER.jsonl row covering it, and the stall rule still applies.
